  (text "INPUT Power: 24V (DC Barrel Jack)\n\nMIC29300 Fixed Regulator - 24V -> 12V\nMIC39101 Fixed Regulator - 12V -> 5V\nTLV76733 Fixed Regulator - 5V -> 3.3V\nOPA2310 Operational Amps - (0-3.3)V -> (0-5)V\n\nI2C (5V/3.3V) Connections:\n\nLabsmith EIB200 and 4VM02 Modules (5V)\nSparkfun MCP4725 12-bit DAC Modules (5V)\nSensirion SLI-0430FMK Flowrate Sensor (5V)\nCG49 Digital Pressure Controllers (5V)\nOLED Display (3.3V)\nBSS138 Level Shifter Circuit - 3.3V -> 5V\n\nAnalog (5V) Connections:\n\nParker (990-005001-015) Pressure Regulator (w/ Internal Vent)\n\nMicrocontroller Module:\n\nESP32-WROOM-32E (3.3V) Dev Kit with 2.4 GHz WiFi + Bluetooth® \n+ Bluetooth LE module "
